→44P0F。锁410项HTTP从392P18F→410P0F，411份raw/candidates除临时运行编号外不变，旧387项非重启观察不变；409份重启快照及cleanup通过。[精确提交CI39153210775](https://github.com/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/actions/runs/39153210775) 已终态通过，后续HTTP/OCR步骤已执行。fa77旧CI唯一失败为测试ready JSON尚未写完就读取，后续HTTP未执行；已修原子发布，原5项断言保持，作者及非实现者9项均通过，旧失败完整归档。旧失败CI、整合失败、夹具错误、原始回答和取消记录均保留，未放宽评分断言。\n\n新公开材料、非专家暂定标注和同输出冻结复评在依赖本PR的 #46。技术回归、隔离Worker/D1/R2接口执行、CI和小样本模型比较均不替代真实案件或人工业务验收。两个PR未合并，未训练、未部署生产；Issue #42 保持打开。\n","created_at":"2026-10-18T03:42:42Z","updated_at":"2026-10-18T18:21:30Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1e400774523ec1081d715f0576a5987fddb8eabf","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/45/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/issues/45/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ZZZZihan/anxin-work-rights/statuses/4c3a0cbfe60623695de5dda67d17339d5e827ac8","head":{"label":"ZZZZihan:feature/material-facts-v7-guards","ref":"feature/material-facts-v7-guards","sha":"4c3a0cbfe60623695de5dda67d17339d5e827ac8","user":{"login":"ZZZZihan","id":113167863,"node_id":"U_kgDOBr7N9w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/113167863?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan","html_url":"https://github.com/ZZZZihan","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ZZZZihan/subscriptions","organizations_url":"ht